  "description": "In-process publish/subscribe for .NET 10, shaped like MQTT and as fast as a method call. Topics with + and # wildcards, retained messages, request/reply, async streams and per-route statistics - with no boxing, no locks and no allocation on the publish path. Built by Gravicode Studios, led by Kang Fadhil.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
