  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.0 - Rewritten for throughput and memory: typed routes resolved once per topic (no boxing, no casts), copy-on-write subscriber arrays read without a lock, and a dispatch loop that allocates nothing until a handler actually suspends. Adds MQTT-style + and # wildcards, retained messages, request/reply, IAsyncEnumerable streams with drop-oldest buffering, per-route statistics, error isolation and pre-resolved topic handles. Targets .NET 10.",
